<title>USA: Riscorp Inc names Richard Franz CFO.</title>
<headline>Riscorp Inc names Richard Franz CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riscorp Inc on Monday said Richard Franz has been named chief financial officer and senior vice president.</p>
<p>Franz succeeds Richard Halloy, who remains a senior vice president of the company and a member of its board.</p>
<p>Franz was concurrently senior vice president, treasurer and chief financial officer of Western Reserve Life Assurance Co and treasurer and principal financial officer for the IDEX Group of Mutual Funds and WRL Series Fund.</p>
</text>
